 ],
 "paragraphs": [
  "Aliya and Zade walked outside. “We need to count the hyacinth flowers but there are so many!” Aliya exclaimed.",
  "The young falcon thought for a moment. “We have 1 twig for every 10 shells. We can use 1 pebble for every 10 twigs. I will watch over our 5 twigs and 8 shells while you count.”",
  "Each time Aliya and Zade collected ten shells, they replaced them with 1 twig, and each time they collected 10 twigs, they replaced them with 1 pebble. When they reached the end, they had 3 pebbles, 4 twigs and 1 shell."
 ],
